  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the robata-grill to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Season the chicken breast with salt, black pepper, and kenyan spice blend.",
    "Grill the chicken for 5-6 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, toss the mixed vegetables with olive oil, chili flakes, and a pinch of salt.",
    "Grill the vegetables for 3-4 minutes, or until slightly charred.",
    "Mix the lemon juice with oregano and a pinch of salt.",
    "Brush the mixture on the grilled chicken and vegetables.",
    "Garnish with fresh cilantro and serve hot."
